DISCLAIMER

This dataset is provided for research and educational purposes. It is an
independent observational recording of publicly displayed market data; it is
not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sourced under any agreement with any
exchange or venue.

Nothing here is financial advice. Past market behaviour does not predict future
market behaviour, and a backtest on this data is not a trading strategy.

The data carries several documented collection artifacts — a four-day outage, a
column that stops being populated partway through, and time-censored labels
among them. Read the "Known issues" section of README.md before training
anything on it. The same issues ship as data_quality.parquet so a pipeline can
assert on them directly.
